watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Biography","Drama","History"],"id":37573,"type":"MOVIE","title":"The Teacher Who Promised the Sea","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/c558bca2-1ee4-4ed2-85a4-8ac804702c73.png","image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/62d2a08f-1b85-451e-b84d-6d6c4065566f.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/efa87570-90c0-49b8-9d2a-8a978cc22e6e.jpg","likes":149,"dislikes":3,"views":4370,"release_date":"1699574400000","length":6380,"description":"Ariadna discovers that her grandfather has been searching for the remains of his father, who disappeared during the Civil War. Determined to help him, she travels to Burgos, where a mass grave is being excavated, and where he could be buried. During her stay there, she will learn the story of Antoni Benaiges, a young teacher from Tarragona who was her grandfather's teacher before the war. Through an innovative pedagogical method, Antoni inspired his students and made them a promise: to take them to see the sea.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.5}],"value":7.5,"age":"R"},"episode_id":997607,"background_color":"#aa0808","content_control":"FAMILY"}}